{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:10.12] Time don't ride when it's around on me (Okay)\n[Chorus]\n[00:16.94] Her eyes shine like the diamonds on my wrist-watch (Bling)\n[00:19.66] Keep giving good love to me baby, don't stop (Uh, uh, please)\n[00:22.92] Keep giving good drugs to me baby, don't stop (Uh, uh, please)\n[00:26.40] Perky 'til my jaw lock, lean 'til my heart stops (Uh, uh, oh)\n[00:29.06] Taking pills 'til I see dead people, like a séance (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:32.78] Look into my pocket, dead people, Ben Franklin (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:35.78] She told me she gon' ride me like a bike, Tour dé France (Yeah, yeah), ooh\n[00:39.62] Do it, no hands, AP watch on both hands (Yeah, yeah)\n[Post-Chorus]\n[00:41.26] (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[00:42.22] Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[00:53.10] Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:57.42] Ch'yeah, watch it glisten, watch it shine\n[00:58.60] I been shittin' on these bitches, and these niggas, I'm in my prime (Uh-huh)\n[01:01.88] Time is money, I got Benjamin Franklin clocks on the wall (Yeah)\n[01:05.02] Big ass Glocks on the wall, .30 clip by my balls (Huh, ch'yeah)\n[01:09.12] New AP, that's a Chandelier-lier-lier-lier\n[01:12.24] Let the choppa sing, sound like Britney Spear-ear-ear-ears (Grahh, grahh)\n[01:15.58] Unbuckle the Gucci belt, dropped the Balenciaga trousers, I'm finna shit on my peers (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[01:19.18] I'm shooting like Rubio, I got a hundred thousand dollars singing in my right ear, yee-haw\n[01:23.50] In my right ear, rich ass cowboy here\n[01:26.16] Buzz like a nigga, Lightyear\n[01:27.76] Take off in a 'Rari like Top Gear, off Percs I steer (Skrrt)\n[01:30.82] Eating too good with no reservations\n[01:32.64] Presidential status, like I'm Ronald Reagan, let's go\n[Chorus]\n[01:35.28] Her eyes shine like the diamonds on my wrist-watch (Bling)\n[01:38.14] Keep giving good love to me baby, don't stop (Uh, uh, please)\n[01:41.72] Keep giving good drugs to me baby, don't stop (Uh, uh, please)\n[01:44.88] Perky 'til my jaw lock, lean 'til my heart stops (Uh, uh, oh)\n[01:47.98] Taking pills 'til I see dead people, like a séance (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:51.30] Look into my pocket, dead people, Ben Franklin (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:54.46] She told me she gon' ride me like a bike, Tour dé France (Yeah, yeah), ooh\n[01:56.72] Do it, no hands, AP watch on both hands (Yeah, yeah)\n[Post-Chorus]\n[01:57.96] Bih-bih, ooh, what, ooh, bih, yeah, huh (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[01:59.38] Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[02:02.28] Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[02:13.84] Gleam\n[Verse 2]\n[02:14.28] AP on my watch nigga don't tick (Nigga don't tick, uh)\n[02:16.98] Go, James Bond with the golden eye, nigga one shot, don’t miss (Uh-huh, let's go)\n[02:20.78] All I know is cash, ball out I swish (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[02:23.96] Disrespect all the opp niggas, all in graves, rest in piss (Fuck 'em)\n[02:27.24] Pull up on the scene (Yeah), looking like a new guy, every single day (Yeah)\n[02:29.96] All I know is ball out, LeBron James (Yeah)\n[02:31.58] Shoot a shot, hit 'em with a fade away (Yeah)\n[02:33.26] In the cut, snip, no scissors nigga, I'ma cut him like a razor blade (Yeah)\n[02:36.52] Pourin' codeine in the Minute Maid (Yeah)\n[02:38.24] I'm a real nigga, niggas been afraid of me (Yeah, brrt)\n[02:40.66] Shit get ugly, ball like Jordan, you play Rugby (Uh-uh, uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[02:43.66] I feel safe with my strap on my left\n[02:44.56] You feel safe when you cuddled up inside a snuggie\n[02:46.22] I don't do buddy buddy, your bitch want a hubby\n[02:47.86] Actually, she admitted that she wanna fuck me (Woah)\n[02:49.66] Got a wife, I won't do it, just thought it was funny (Uh)\n[02:51.08] That shit sting like a